### 船舶危险货箱配载审定服务 REST 示例（VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client）
### 变量 @id 在首次创建后手动替换，或用客户端的脚本能力提取。

@host = http://localhost:3000
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### 登记航次
POST {{host}}/api/voyages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voyageNo": "V-2026-001",
  "bays": 3,
  "rows": 2,
  "tiers": 3,
  "defaultColumnWeightLimit": "10000",
  "columnWeightLimits": [
    { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "weightLimit": "1200" }
  ],
  "boxes": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-1", "weight": "500",    "category": "1" },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-2", "weight": "600",    "category": "3" },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-3", "weight": "400",    "category": "5" },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-4", "weight": "300.25", "category": "1" }
  ],
  "incompatRules": [
    { "categoryA": "1", "categoryB": "3", "minDistance": 3 }
  ]
}

### 航次列表
GET {{host}}/api/voyages

### 当前布局
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/layout

### 历史布局（某修订号）
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/layout?rev=1

### 整批调整（携带所见修订号；position=null 表示暂留空；允许同批交换）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 0,
  "moves": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-1", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 0 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-2", "position": { "bay": 3, "row": 2, "tier": 0 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-3", "position": { "bay": 2, "row": 2, "tier": 0 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-4", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 1 } }
  ]
}

### 同批交换（同列上下互换）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 1,
  "moves": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-1", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 1 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-4", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 0 } }
  ]
}

### 撤位（暂留空）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 2,
  "moves": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-3", "position": null }
  ]
}

### 安全约束变更（携带所见修订号；整套替换；受理前按新约束复验当前布局）
### 未列出的按列覆盖/不相容类别对即撤销；舱位尺寸与箱档案不变
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/constraints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 2,
  "defaultColumnWeightLimit": "9000",
  "columnWeightLimits": [
    { "bay": 2, "row": 2, "weightLimit": "9999" }
  ],
  "incompatRules": [
    { "categoryA": "1", "categoryB": "5", "minDistance": 2 }
  ]
}

### 历史布局同时返回该修订号当时生效的约束（默认承重/覆盖/类别对）
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/layout?rev=1

### 签发装载清单（所有箱须已配位；冻结当前修订号）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/manifests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": 4
}

### 清单列表（旧清单保留，current 标识是否指向当前布局）
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/manifests

### 取某修订号的冻结清单
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/manifests/4

### 现场装船核对：以已签发清单 rev=4 开启作业（同一清单最多一个）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/check-jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manifestRevision": 4
}

### 航次下的核对作业列表
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/check-jobs

@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 查询核对状态：应装/已核对/缺失/错位/清单外箱
GET {{host}}/api/check-jobs/{{jobId}}

### 上报实装位置（reportNo 为作业内唯一上报号；相同号+相同内容重试幂等）
POST {{host}}/api/check-jobs/{{jobId}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportNo": "RPT-0001",
  "boxNo": "BOX-1",
  "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 0 }
}

### 上报撤销（position=null 表示未装；该箱回到“缺失”）
POST {{host}}/api/check-jobs/{{jobId}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportNo": "RPT-0002",
  "boxNo": "BOX-2",
  "position": null
}

### 上报留痕（按受理顺序）
GET {{host}}/api/check-jobs/{{jobId}}/reports

### 结案：全部一致且无清单外箱才冻结；否则 409 返回差异，作业继续开放
POST {{host}}/api/check-jobs/{{jobId}}/close

### ============================================================
### 试排方案（stowage plan）：从当前修订号 fork 的独立沙箱
### ============================================================

@planId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 建立试排方案（请求体可空 = 从当前修订号 fork；可带 baseRevision 读后确认）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/stowage-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 建立试排方案（显式携带所见航次修订号，过期 -> 409 stale_revision）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/stowage-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 1
}

### 航次下方案列表（版本/状态/已配位箱数；不含布局明细）
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/stowage-plans

### 查询方案：当前试排布局 + 创建时固定约束 + 来源/方案/航次版本
GET {{host}}/api/stowage-plans/{{planId}}

### 方案内整批调整（baseRevision 为方案修订号；失败不改变方案）
POST {{host}}/api/stowage-plans/{{planId}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 0,
  "moves": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-2", "position": { "bay": 2, "row": 2, "tier": 0 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-3", "position": null }
  ]
}

### 发布方案：来源修订号仍是航次当前修订号 -> 201 原子写入新修订号并继承约束；
### 航次已演进 -> 409 plan_publish_conflict（方案保留）；已发布重复发布 -> 200 replay
POST {{host}}/api/stowage-plans/{{planId}}/publish
